      "Flavius Josephus, <i>The Jewish War</i>, book 6, chapter 1, trans. William Whiston, Perseus Digital Library, https://www.perseus.tufts.edu/hopper/text?doc=Perseus:text:1999.01.0148:book=6:whiston%20chapter=1. [Open access]",
